{"availability":"available","full":"Cubix33/taaza-hawa","name":"taaza-hawa","description":"अभी बाहर जाऊँ? Delhi station air with its age, a calibrated range when it's stale, and a public self-grading scoreboard. WeMakeDevs × AWS Environmental Hacks 2026 (Air track).","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T12:29:16Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:31:08Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://main.d2r1frd99buxhf.amplifyapp.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:26.012Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:26.012Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:26.012Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:26.012Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Delhi's air-quality number, with its age. An honest range when it's old. A public grade when the truth arrives. And a 06:30 plan for every school: assembly, PE, recess.","The sky, the haze and the sun are an illustrative artwork parameterized by Delhi's live AQI: clear air looks clear, smog looks like smog. (Screenshots on this page use clearly labelled demo data.)"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Cubix33/taaza-hawa/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d7f7499112e4392a3c79fe33a645b8284b56bc9cfbe104bef6d244900cbf6af0","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:26.151Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:26.151Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Delhi's air-quality number, with its age. An honest range when it's old. A public grade when the truth arrives. And a 06:30 plan for every school: assembly, PE, recess.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Cubix33/taaza-hawa/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Also: \"What will you do outside?\" chips (walk, jog, run, child playing) that explain how much more air you breathe than sitting (US EPA rates; the verdict never changes); a last-24-hours line that shows